                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "\"Generations of bad health policy have moved Americans away from choice and competition and quality and in the direction of consolidation and single payer healthcare.\"\n\nOne of the few bright spots in our healthcare system are Associated Health Plans. \n\nToday, I was happy to speak in support of Chairman @RepWalberg's \"Association Health Plans Act.\"",
